knight silver~
A knight of the Silver Legion~
A knight in silver armor stands here, covered with a thin layer of dust.
~
You can't see any body parts holding up the armor, but there must be
SOMEthing in there since armor doesn't just stand up by itself.  The
breastplate bears the crest of the Silver Legion, an ancient group of 
knights that followed the teachings of Sand. . . .
~
